{"page":527,"verses":[{"verse_key":"53:27","surah":53,"ayah":27,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ لَيُسَمُّونَ ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةَ تَسْمِيَةَ ٱلْأُنثَىٰ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who deny the life to come give the angels female names.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"53:27"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"53:27"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"53:27"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"53:27"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","en_gloss":"in the Hereafter","transliteration":"bil-ākhirati","verse_key":"53:27"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَيُسَمُّونَ","en_gloss":"surely they name","transliteration":"layusammūna","verse_key":"53:27"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةَ","en_gloss":"the Angels","transliteration":"l-malāikata","verse_key":"53:27"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَسْمِيَةَ","en_gloss":"name(s)","transliteration":"tasmiyata","verse_key":"53:27"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْأُنثَىٰ","en_gloss":"(of) female","transliteration":"l-unthā","verse_key":"53:27"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٢٧","en_gloss":"(27)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"53:27"}]},{"verse_key":"53:28","surah":53,"ayah":28,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا لَهُم بِهِۦ مِنْ عِلْمٍ ۖ إِن يَتَّبِعُونَ إِلَّا ٱلظَّنَّ ۖ وَإِنَّ ٱلظَّنَّ لَا يُغْنِى مِنَ ٱلْحَقِّ شَيْـًٔا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They have no knowledge to base this on: they merely follow guesswork. Guesswork is of no value against the Truth.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"53:28"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَهُم","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"53:28"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"about it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"53:28"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"53:28"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عِلْمٍ ۖ","en_gloss":"knowled